---
// Editorial Mission Statement Component: Premium International Standard
---

<section class="bg-[#101B2D] text-white py-20 sm:py-24 relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="mission-heading">
  <!-- Fine Technical Grid Line Motif -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-10" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="editorial-grid" width="32" height="32" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <path d="M 32 0 L 0 0 0 32" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1" />
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#editorial-grid)" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="container-main text-center">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">

      <!-- Eyebrow Badge -->
      <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-sky-400/25 bg-sky-500/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-sky-300 uppercase">
        <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#3478F6]"></span>
        <span>Our Mission</span>
      </div>

      <h2 id="mission-heading" class="sr-only">Our Mission</h2>

      <!-- Large Stylized Quotation Mark -->
      <span class="block text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-serif text-sky-400/30 select-none -mb-4 sm:-mb-6" aria-hidden="true">
        &ldquo;
      </span>

      <!-- Exact Required Editorial Quote -->
      <blockquote class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-medium leading-relaxed tracking-tight text-slate-100">
        Knowledge becomes powerful when it is accessible. CURION explores the ideas, discoveries and innovations shaping our world, helping readers understand complex subjects through clear, useful and thoughtful content.
      </blockquote>

      <!-- Mission Attribution Bar -->
      <div class="mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-slate-700/60 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 text-xs text-slate-300">
        <span class="font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">CURION</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-slate-600">&bull;</span>
        <a href="/articles/" class="hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors">Browse All Articles</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-slate-600">&bull;</span>
        <a href="/about/" class="hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors">About Our Blog</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-slate-600">&bull;</span>
        <a href="/contact/" class="hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors">Get In Touch</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
